    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "text": "How we work, and work together.\n\nOur values guide how we work to drive real-world impact, turning visionary ideas into systems that navigate highways and transform lives.\n\n01.\nScientific\n\nWe embrace objectivity, act with integrity, and view leadership as what you bring to work every day.\n\n02.\nCurious\n\nWe ask hard questions, challenge our assumptions, and seek deeper understanding before answers.\n\n03.\nDiverse\n\nWe assume good intentions, encourage respectful discourse, and treat differences as essential, not optional.\n\n04.\nResilient\n\nWe meet challenges with grit, creativity, and optimism \u2013 turning setbacks into breakthroughs.\n\n05.\nAccountable\n\nWe own our words and actions. We follow through on commitments andcommunicate changes openly.\n\n06.\nSafe\n\nSafety is non-negotiable. Every decision and interaction strengthens the safety of our people, our product, and our world.\n\n07.\nEfficient\n\nWe work with focus and purpose, designing processes that favor reliability and efficiency over speed alone.\n\n08.\nData Driven\n\nWe take calculated risks, validate with evidence, and act decisively. Data fuels conviction, conviction accelerates progress, and progress generates more data \u2013 creating a virtuous cycle of innovation.",
      "cls": "careers-values",
      "rect": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3409.1875,
        "width": 390,
        "height": 637.84375,
        "top": 3409.1875,
        "right": 390,
        "bottom": 4047.03125,
        "left": 0
      },
      "font": "16px Zagma, Georgia, serif",
      "tracking": "normal",
      "padding": "60px 0px",
      "gap": "60px",
      "background": "rgb(249, 246, 248)"
    },
    {
      "tag": "SECTION",
      "text": "Fuel your career's next mile.\n\nWaabi is where personal growth and breakthrough innovation go hand in hand. With 5 North American offices and remote flexibility, you can learn and thrive wherever you work best.\n\nExplore open roles",
